// Martin's OCP example (Agile Software Development, chapter 9), the repaired version: Client uses an interface it owns, which Server implements. Client uses the
// concrete Server. Two axes: the servers, which change more often than the client (a new server is the change).
axis client  = [martin.ocp.client]
axis servers = [martin.ocp.server]
// the speed order; it generates hide servers from client
speed client < servers;
